{"video_id":"XWNfBM5VFcU","title":"Lightning Talk: Why Don't AI Technologies and CI/CD Pipelines Get Along? - Ryo Sugahara","conference":"lf-ai-dev","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":1225,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"duration":3.8,"text":"Hello hello again everyone."},{"start":2.62,"duration":4.86,"text":">> [laughter]"},{"start":3.8,"duration":5.4,"text":">> Thanks to the opportunity to speak today"},{"start":7.48,"duration":5.48,"text":"in this session."},{"start":9.2,"duration":7.32,"text":"I'll share my journey exploring why AI"},{"start":12.96,"duration":6.6,"text":"technologies and the CCD pipelines serve"},{"start":16.52,"duration":4.4,"text":"to work well together."},{"start":19.56,"duration":2.12,"text":"By the way,"},{"start":20.92,"duration":3.88,"text":"uh"},{"start":21.68,"duration":6.52,"text":"English is not"},{"start":24.8,"duration":6.88,"text":"my strongest skill, you know. So,"},{"start":28.2,"duration":6.52,"text":"please go easy on me."},{"start":31.68,"duration":3.04,"text":"Ready to get started."},{"start":39.24,"duration":6.24,"text":"Uh before I dive into that topic, my"},{"start":41.96,"duration":4.76,"text":"name is Rio Sugahara. I'm already from"},{"start":45.48,"duration":4.44,"text":"Tokyo."},{"start":46.72,"duration":5.8,"text":"Uh working at the NTT Data Group as a"},{"start":49.92,"duration":5.4,"text":"DevOps infrastructure engineer, a"},{"start":52.52,"duration":5.56,"text":"technical manager, and a platform"},{"start":55.32,"duration":4.36,"text":"modernization evangelist."},{"start":58.08,"duration":2.68,"text":"Uh so, actually,"},{"start":59.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"uh I"},{"start":60.76,"duration":7.04,"text":"got the email from the foundation, and"},{"start":63.76,"duration":5.8,"text":"it was late of March. So, that"},{"start":67.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"in my e-"},{"start":69.56,"duration":6.16,"text":"hometown, so the cherry blossoms"},{"start":72.6,"duration":6.44,"text":"tourists just have just started to"},{"start":75.72,"duration":5.04,"text":"bloom. So, I decided to use"},{"start":79.04,"duration":5.24,"text":"cherry blossom"},{"start":80.76,"duration":6.24,"text":"uh photo background, you know."},{"start":84.28,"duration":2.72,"text":"Let's move on."},{"start":87.32,"duration":5.32,"text":"Uh first,"},{"start":89.08,"duration":5.4,"text":"what do you expect from AI in software"},{"start":92.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"development?"},{"start":94.48,"duration":6.24,"text":"In general,"},{"start":96.92,"duration":7.8,"text":"uh we expect things to become faster,"},{"start":100.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"cheaper, and smarter."},{"start":104.88,"duration":2.44,"text":"Uh"},{"start":105.68,"duration":3.36,"text":"expectations,"},{"start":107.32,"duration":6.04,"text":"however,"},{"start":109.04,"duration":7.96,"text":"vary depending on your role."},{"start":113.36,"duration":8.32,"text":"If you are developers,"},{"start":117.0,"duration":7.96,"text":"uh you may expect a smarter automation."},{"start":121.68,"duration":8.44,"text":"If you are managers,"},{"start":124.96,"duration":7.88,"text":"you may focus on productivity gains."},{"start":130.12,"duration":6.6,"text":"If you are executives,"},{"start":132.84,"duration":7.0,"text":"you would do often care most about the"},{"start":136.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"cost to reduction."},{"start":139.84,"duration":5.36,"text":"In my case,"},{"start":141.44,"duration":6.04,"text":"I expected that the CI/CD pipeline could"},{"start":145.2,"duration":5.8,"text":"be much smarter"},{"start":147.48,"duration":7.16,"text":"uh with AI. Like a pipeline could"},{"start":151.0,"duration":7.36,"text":"suggest a solution to deliver faster at"},{"start":154.64,"duration":5.36,"text":"the same time as errors occurred in the"},{"start":158.36,"duration":5.68,"text":"pipeline."},{"start":160.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"I think it's already uh"},{"start":164.04,"duration":7.44,"text":"uh"},{"start":164.6,"duration":6.88,"text":"reality on some IDEs such as VS Code."},{"start":171.72,"duration":9.28,"text":"Uh but I haven't to really heard of such"},{"start":176.24,"duration":8.96,"text":"a feature being implemented in CI/CD"},{"start":181.0,"duration":7.76,"text":"pipelines. So, why doesn't AI fit"},{"start":185.2,"duration":6.56,"text":"naturally into CI/CD pipelines?"},{"start":188.76,"duration":5.4,"text":"The very place where automation should"},{"start":191.76,"duration":2.4,"text":"shine."},{"start":195.2,"duration":5.72,"text":"CI/CD pipelines are fundamentally"},{"start":198.32,"duration":5.72,"text":"deterministic systems."},{"start":200.92,"duration":5.64,"text":"The same input to always produces the"},{"start":204.04,"duration":6.92,"text":"same output."},{"start":206.56,"duration":7.52,"text":"If the output changes without any"},{"start":210.96,"duration":5.44,"text":"changes in input, the system is"},{"start":214.08,"duration":4.4,"text":"considered broken."},{"start":216.4,"duration":5.84,"text":"To achieve this,"},{"start":218.48,"duration":6.64,"text":"CI/CD pipelines must satisfy"},{"start":222.24,"duration":4.88,"text":"three key requirements."},{"start":225.12,"duration":4.44,"text":"First,"},{"start":227.12,"duration":5.96,"text":"reproducibility."},{"start":229.56,"duration":5.2,"text":"Every task must produce consistent"},{"start":233.08,"duration":3.6,"text":"results."},{"start":234.76,"duration":4.72,"text":"Second,"},{"start":236.68,"duration":6.24,"text":"IDM potency."},{"start":239.48,"duration":7.08,"text":"Running the same task multiple"},{"start":242.92,"duration":6.8,"text":"times with the same input should always"},{"start":246.56,"duration":4.76,"text":"yield the same outcome."},{"start":249.72,"duration":4.28,"text":"Third,"},{"start":251.32,"duration":6.56,"text":"reliability."},{"start":254.0,"duration":6.04,"text":"The pipeline must be dependable."},{"start":257.88,"duration":5.12,"text":"After all,"},{"start":260.04,"duration":5.36,"text":"and no one wants to rely on an"},{"start":263.0,"duration":4.16,"text":"unreliable pipeline for critical"},{"start":265.4,"duration":3.16,"text":"assistance."},{"start":267.16,"duration":2.92,"text":"Of course,"},{"start":268.56,"duration":5.48,"text":"me neither."},{"start":270.08,"duration":8.8,"text":"I don't want to get"},{"start":274.04,"duration":9.4,"text":"yelled at by my boss if I make my boss"},{"start":278.88,"duration":4.56,"text":"getting angry. It's so terrible."},{"start":283.68,"duration":6.16,"text":"On the other hand,"},{"start":285.88,"duration":8.6,"text":"what about the case of AI systems?"},{"start":289.84,"duration":4.64,"text":"I will mention it on the next slides."},{"start":294.88,"duration":6.68,"text":"AI systems, in contrast,"},{"start":298.28,"duration":3.28,"text":"are probabilistic."},{"start":301.6,"duration":7.16,"text":"The same input doesn't always produce"},{"start":305.88,"duration":6.72,"text":"the same output."},{"start":308.76,"duration":8.84,"text":"AI generates answers that"},{"start":312.6,"duration":9.44,"text":"are statistically likely to be valuable."},{"start":317.6,"duration":6.08,"text":"In a CI/CD pipeline that run daily,"},{"start":322.04,"duration":3.68,"text":"this become"},{"start":323.68,"duration":5.08,"text":"a serious issue."},{"start":325.72,"duration":4.04,"text":"Even if nothing changes in the source"},{"start":328.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"code,"},{"start":329.76,"duration":6.52,"text":"there is no guarantee the system will"},{"start":332.76,"duration":6.84,"text":"behave the same way tomorrow."},{"start":336.28,"duration":6.36,"text":"This is a critical problem for operators"},{"start":339.6,"duration":7.36,"text":"and of course users."},{"start":342.64,"duration":8.28,"text":"This is applying AI to CI/CD pipelines"},{"start":346.96,"duration":9.56,"text":"is difficult even in a"},{"start":350.92,"duration":7.32,"text":"where it could potentially reduce costs."},{"start":356.52,"duration":4.12,"text":"In contrast,"},{"start":358.24,"duration":7.08,"text":"in coding tasks,"},{"start":360.64,"duration":8.56,"text":"human intervention bridges the gap."},{"start":365.32,"duration":8.04,"text":"Developers review, validate, and modify"},{"start":369.2,"duration":8.4,"text":"AI-generated code before using it."},{"start":373.36,"duration":7.24,"text":"That's why AI works well there."},{"start":377.6,"duration":6.76,"text":"It improves productivity without"},{"start":380.6,"duration":3.76,"text":"requiring full trust."},{"start":386.24,"duration":6.76,"text":"Uh let me summarize."},{"start":388.72,"duration":6.48,"text":"CI/CD pipelines require determinism,"},{"start":393.0,"duration":4.24,"text":"repeatability,"},{"start":395.2,"duration":4.44,"text":"and verifiability,"},{"start":397.24,"duration":5.2,"text":"and stability."},{"start":399.64,"duration":7.64,"text":"AI, on the other hand,"},{"start":402.44,"duration":6.8,"text":"is probabilistic, non-deterministic,"},{"start":407.28,"duration":5.56,"text":"hard to verify,"},{"start":409.24,"duration":8.64,"text":"and the continuously improving."},{"start":412.84,"duration":7.44,"text":"CI/CD demands certainty."},{"start":417.88,"duration":5.04,"text":"AI introduces"},{"start":420.28,"duration":5.8,"text":"uncertainty."},{"start":422.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"This creates a fundamental tension"},{"start":426.08,"duration":5.6,"text":"between the two."},{"start":428.36,"duration":6.72,"text":"In many high-impact"},{"start":431.68,"duration":6.84,"text":"cost-saving use cases,"},{"start":435.08,"duration":7.32,"text":"this uncertainty is acceptable because"},{"start":438.52,"duration":6.32,"text":"humans are involved. For example, code"},{"start":442.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"suggestion tools."},{"start":444.84,"duration":6.52,"text":"CI/CD pipelines,"},{"start":447.2,"duration":7.48,"text":"however, are designed to minimize"},{"start":451.36,"duration":7.52,"text":"or eliminate human intervention."},{"start":454.68,"duration":8.0,"text":"That means AI can only be applied to"},{"start":458.88,"duration":6.6,"text":"limited use cases within CI/CD,"},{"start":462.68,"duration":4.32,"text":"such as generating"},{"start":465.48,"duration":4.96,"text":"notifications"},{"start":467.0,"duration":7.04,"text":"or recommendations."},{"start":470.44,"duration":6.84,"text":"But do those use cases deliver"},{"start":474.04,"duration":6.0,"text":"significant cost reductions?"},{"start":477.28,"duration":7.08,"text":"The answer is no."},{"start":480.04,"duration":4.32,"text":"Now, let me share my experience."},{"start":485.84,"duration":6.84,"text":"I proposed to introducing AI into our CD"},{"start":490.88,"duration":5.32,"text":"pipelines."},{"start":492.68,"duration":7.12,"text":"I discussed the idea of using AI much"},{"start":496.2,"duration":7.6,"text":"more smartly with the team members and"},{"start":499.8,"duration":6.04,"text":"presented my approach to assets and"},{"start":503.8,"duration":3.76,"text":"managers."},{"start":505.84,"duration":4.6,"text":"For example,"},{"start":507.56,"duration":5.32,"text":"automated solution suggestions"},{"start":510.44,"duration":5.32,"text":"and log analysis"},{"start":512.88,"duration":7.08,"text":"and the similar smart features."},{"start":515.76,"duration":7.96,"text":"Technically, the ideas were interesting"},{"start":519.96,"duration":5.96,"text":"and should improve the developers'"},{"start":523.72,"duration":5.8,"text":"experience."},{"start":525.92,"duration":6.24,"text":"We also estimated the potential cost"},{"start":529.52,"duration":4.56,"text":"savings."},{"start":532.16,"duration":6.44,"text":"Despite this,"},{"start":534.08,"duration":7.92,"text":"only a few of those benefits could be"},{"start":538.6,"duration":5.48,"text":"quantified clearly."},{"start":542.0,"duration":5.92,"text":"As a result,"},{"start":544.08,"duration":6.12,"text":"the proposal was rejected."},{"start":547.92,"duration":5.68,"text":"The expected to"},{"start":550.2,"duration":7.64,"text":"return didn't justify the cost of"},{"start":553.6,"duration":8.16,"text":"implementing AI. Honestly,"},{"start":557.84,"duration":10.0,"text":"that decision was reasonable."},{"start":561.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"It was difficult to argue against it."},{"start":570.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"Here is my conclusion this transfer."},{"start":573.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"First,"},{"start":575.12,"duration":4.92,"text":"there's no doubt it was it for"},{"start":578.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"developers."},{"start":580.04,"duration":4.56,"text":"I I agree"},{"start":581.84,"duration":4.32,"text":"there was a value for developers."},{"start":584.6,"duration":4.36,"text":"However,"},{"start":586.16,"duration":6.84,"text":"um that value doesn't really translate"},{"start":588.96,"duration":5.56,"text":"into return on investment to at the"},{"start":593.0,"duration":3.0,"text":"organizational"},{"start":594.52,"duration":3.36,"text":"level."},{"start":596.0,"duration":6.24,"text":"Second,"},{"start":597.88,"duration":8.12,"text":"um not worth the return on investment."},{"start":602.24,"duration":6.92,"text":"It might be a little extreme way of"},{"start":606.0,"duration":5.0,"text":"serving. If you accept it to at the"},{"start":609.16,"duration":5.08,"text":"first value,"},{"start":611.0,"duration":7.04,"text":"uh what do I want to say is"},{"start":614.24,"duration":7.0,"text":"that it's extremely difficult to explain"},{"start":618.04,"duration":6.96,"text":"that cost reduction when using"},{"start":621.24,"duration":6.84,"text":"traditional manual based"},{"start":625.0,"duration":4.4,"text":"cost estimation."},{"start":628.08,"duration":4.88,"text":"Third,"},{"start":629.4,"duration":7.48,"text":"find the value uh beyond cost reduction"},{"start":632.96,"duration":9.64,"text":"that executives actually care about."},{"start":636.88,"duration":9.36,"text":"If we want to want to executive buy-in,"},{"start":642.6,"duration":7.12,"text":"we need to go beyond the manual based"},{"start":646.24,"duration":7.76,"text":"cost unfortunately."},{"start":649.72,"duration":7.0,"text":"It should be quantitative quantitative"},{"start":654.0,"duration":5.24,"text":"benefits because we can already"},{"start":656.72,"duration":4.04,"text":"experience explain"},{"start":659.24,"duration":5.8,"text":"qualitative"},{"start":660.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"benefits using AI on the CI/CD"},{"start":665.04,"duration":3.12,"text":"pipelines."},{"start":666.6,"duration":5.04,"text":"Ultimately,"},{"start":668.16,"duration":7.2,"text":"to justify the investment,"},{"start":671.64,"duration":6.88,"text":"we must translate this into clear"},{"start":675.36,"duration":7.2,"text":"explainable system-level"},{"start":678.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"quantitative benefit."},{"start":683.72,"duration":5.2,"text":"Integrating"},{"start":685.36,"duration":8.36,"text":"AI into CI/CD pipelines is like walking"},{"start":688.92,"duration":7.8,"text":"a thorny path. In Japanese, we call it"},{"start":693.72,"duration":5.52,"text":"Ibarano Michi."},{"start":696.72,"duration":5.84,"text":"You know, it's valuable."},{"start":699.24,"duration":6.28,"text":"But, every step comes with the"},{"start":702.56,"duration":4.28,"text":"challenges and pain."},{"start":705.52,"duration":4.08,"text":"Still,"},{"start":706.84,"duration":5.08,"text":"it's pain. And it's a path was"},{"start":709.6,"duration":4.76,"text":"exploring."},{"start":711.92,"duration":2.44,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":717.23,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"},{"start":723.04,"duration":2.28,"text":">> Sorry?"},{"start":727.08,"duration":5.48,"text":"Uh well,"},{"start":729.24,"duration":4.96,"text":"my executive told me that"},{"start":732.56,"duration":4.76,"text":"you know,"},{"start":734.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"introducing AI system is a really"},{"start":737.32,"duration":3.72,"text":"high cost of"},{"start":738.76,"duration":5.72,"text":"elements such as"},{"start":741.04,"duration":5.8,"text":"and also GPUs or"},{"start":744.48,"duration":5.84,"text":"SASU elements like"},{"start":746.84,"duration":5.56,"text":"critical or something like that. But, uh"},{"start":750.32,"duration":5.28,"text":"uh executive"},{"start":752.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"expects to reduce manpower developing"},{"start":755.6,"duration":5.28,"text":"costs."},{"start":756.96,"duration":3.92,"text":"So, they rejected my idea."},{"start":762.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"Is it the answer? Okay."},{"start":765.44,"duration":4.32,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":767.32,"duration":2.44,"text":"Okay."},{"start":791.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"Uh you mean"},{"start":793.64,"duration":6.32,"text":"open source"},{"start":795.28,"duration":6.28,"text":"uh module using for CI/CD."},{"start":799.96,"duration":3.16,"text":"It's uh"},{"start":801.56,"duration":3.96,"text":"uh"},{"start":803.12,"duration":2.4,"text":"Sorry."},{"start":812.56,"duration":2.16,"text":">> Mhm."},{"start":826.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":827.92,"duration":5.4,"text":"Yeah, of course I agree with it's one"},{"start":830.4,"duration":2.92,"text":"thing but"},{"start":833.6,"duration":6.72,"text":"I I don't I know not to say why it's"},{"start":836.04,"duration":9.48,"text":"Japanese experience to culture. So we"},{"start":840.32,"duration":6.92,"text":"have to explain about that how reduce"},{"start":845.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"manual"},{"start":847.24,"duration":4.88,"text":"cost. So but"},{"start":849.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"it's so difficult to explain."},{"start":852.12,"duration":2.56,"text":"Is this answer?"},{"start":853.96,"duration":2.96,"text":"Okay."},{"start":854.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"So could you I guess you're talking"},{"start":856.92,"duration":3.28,"text":"tomorrow to discuss further how you deal"},{"start":859.28,"duration":2.88,"text":"with the"},{"start":860.2,"duration":4.0,"text":"fundamental problem that"},{"start":862.16,"duration":4.16,"text":"real world most of"},{"start":864.2,"duration":4.88,"text":"AI is not deterministic. It's"},{"start":866.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"fundamentally probability and and CI"},{"start":869.08,"duration":3.72,"text":"we're used to thinking of it as"},{"start":870.24,"duration":4.44,"text":"absolutely deterministic."},{"start":872.8,"duration":4.12,"text":"So will you discuss that tomorrow or is"},{"start":874.68,"duration":4.04,"text":"that a Yeah, I can also like just in a"},{"start":876.92,"duration":4.08,"text":"nutshell we basically"},{"start":878.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"do things like we have"},{"start":881.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"deterministic qualifications Mhm. that"},{"start":883.08,"duration":4.64,"text":"we pass by the AI and we only use AI to"},{"start":885.48,"duration":3.16,"text":"reduce the algorithm of AI"},{"start":887.72,"duration":3.24,"text":"and we have"},{"start":888.64,"duration":3.12,"text":"gaining and scoring on AI on the basis"},{"start":890.96,"duration":3.76,"text":"of"},{"start":891.76,"duration":2.96,"text":"and if it goes through"},{"start":895.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"So you you process what"},{"start":897.0,"duration":6.0,"text":"So your way of bridging the gap is"},{"start":900.24,"duration":4.12,"text":"strive to make AI deterministic at the"},{"start":903.0,"duration":2.92,"text":"places where it's important to be"},{"start":904.36,"duration":2.92,"text":"deterministic. Yeah, we have our own"},{"start":905.92,"duration":2.92,"text":"algorithm."},{"start":907.28,"duration":4.16,"text":"Got it."},{"start":908.84,"duration":3.8,"text":"Sorry. [laughter] Thank you."},{"start":911.44,"duration":3.6,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":912.64,"duration":2.4,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":915.04,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"}]}